<section class="section future" id="future" aria-labelledby="future-title">
  <div class="section-inner future-spread">
    <header class="future-intro" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="future-title">还有些小事，<br />想一起做。</h2>
      <p>想到一件就写下来。<br />不用着急，一件一件来。</p>
      <button class="draw-button" type="button" data-wish-draw data-needs-js hidden><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> 从清单里抽一件</button>
      <p class="draw-result" data-wish-result role="status" data-needs-js hidden></p>
    </header>
    <div class="future-paper" data-reveal>
      <span class="tape tape-corner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="future-paper-head"><h3>往后的小清单</h3><span data-wish-count data-needs-js hidden>还空着</span></div>
      <div class="notebook-guest" data-wish-guest>
        <p>解锁后，翻看我们的记录</p>
        <button class="pencil-button" type="button" data-open-login data-needs-js>解锁手账</button>
      </div>
      <div class="notebook-loading" data-wish-loading hidden>
        <p data-wish-loading-status role="status">正在打开云端手账…</p>
        <button class="text-button" type="button" data-wish-retry hidden>重新连接</button>
      </div>
      <div data-wish-private hidden>
        <p class="wish-empty" data-wish-empty>第一件，留给我们自己写。</p>
        <ul class="wish-list" data-wish-list></ul>
        <form class="wish-form" data-wish-form>
          <label class="sr-only" for="wish-text">想一起做的小事</label>
          <input id="wish-text" type="text" maxlength="120" required placeholder="写下一件想一起做的事" autocomplete="off" />
          <button class="pencil-button" type="submit">记上</button>
        </form>
        <p class="notebook-status" data-wish-status role="status"></p>
        <button class="text-button" type="button" data-wish-refresh hidden>刷新查看</button>
        <button class="text-button" type="button" data-wish-undo hidden>撤销刚才的移除</button>
      </div>
      <noscript><p class="paper-local">开启 JavaScript 后，可以解锁共同手账。</p></noscript>
    </div>
    <div class="notebook-tools" data-wish-private hidden>
      <p>登录后，日记和清单会保存在云端。导入旧手账时，原来的设备记录会保留。</p>
      <div class="paper-actions">
        <button class="text-button" type="button" data-notebook-export>带走手账 ↓</button>
        <button class="text-button" type="button" data-notebook-import>从备份放回 ↑</button>
        <button class="text-button" type="button" data-notebook-local-import>导入这台设备的旧手账</button>
      </div>
      <input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-notebook-file hidden aria-label="选择手账备份" />
      <p class="notebook-status" data-notebook-status role="status"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<dialog class="notebook-import-dialog" data-import-dialog aria-labelledby="notebook-import-title">
  <form method="dialog" data-import-form>
    <h2 id="notebook-import-title">有些记录的日期或编号相同</h2>
    <p>逐条选择保留云端内容，或用备份里的内容替换。</p>
    <div data-import-conflicts></div>
    <div class="paper-actions notebook-import-actions">
      <button class="text-button" type="button" data-import-cancel>先不导入</button>
      <button class="pencil-button" type="submit" data-import-confirm>按选择导入</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>
